@page "/ui-blocks-product-cards"

<RadzenText TextStyle="TextStyle.H2" TagName="TagName.H1" class="rz-pt-8">
    Product Card blocks
</RadzenText>

<RadzenText TextStyle="TextStyle.Subtitle1" TagName="TagName.P" class="rz-pb-4" Style="max-width: 1000px;">
    A product card block presents a single item for sale: photo, name, price, and the action that puts it in the cart. Cards are the building unit of every shop grid: drop one into your own row, column, or data-bound list and repeat it. Ready-made grid arrangements are in the Product List blocks.
</RadzenText>

<RadzenText Anchor="ui-blocks-product-cards#simple-product-card" TextStyle="TextStyle.H5" TagName="TagName.H2" class="rz-pt-12">
    Simple product card
</RadzenText>
<RadzenText TextStyle="TextStyle.Body1" class="rz-mb-8">
    A product card block with photo, name, and price.
</RadzenText>
<RadzenCard class="rz-p-0 rz-material-3-demo-card">
    <RadzenTabs class="example-tabs">
        <Tabs>
            <RadzenTabsItem Text="Theme's default">
                <UIBlock Path="/product-cards/simple-product-card" Title="Simple product card" />
            </RadzenTabsItem>
            <UIBlocks />
        </Tabs>
    </RadzenTabs>
</RadzenCard>

